# Cloud Storage & Asset Management Principles

- All uploaded files, paths, and keys MUST be partitioned clearly by organization ID to avoid cross-tenant security breaches.
- **Path Pattern:** `organizations/{organizationId}/{feature}/{filename}`
- Do not download massive file buffers directly to serverless API memory. Use pre-signed URLs for client-side uploads or pass file streams to background workers.